     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:7pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">Issue #29\r\n</span><span lang=\"ZH-CN\" style=\"font-size:7pt;font-family:SimSun\">中提到</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:7pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">\r\nuser_weight</span><span lang=\"ZH-CN\" style=\"font-size:7pt;font-family:SimSun\">的处理</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:7pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span lang=\"ZH-CN\" style=\"font-size:7pt;font-family:SimSun\">很抱歉，基础不足，想请问您所谓从</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:7.5pt;font-family:Helvetica,sans-serif;color:rgb(51,51,51);border:1pt none windowtext;padding:0cm\"> GitHub </span><span lang=\"ZH-CN\" style=\"font-size:7.5pt;font-family:SimSun;color:rgb(51,51,51);border:1pt none windowtext;padding:0cm\">安装就行，该如何做呢？</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:7pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span lang=\"ZH-CN\" style=\"font-size:7pt;font-family:SimSun\"><span lang=\"ZH-CN\" style=\"font-size:13px\">在</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px\">window</span><span lang=\"ZH-CN\" style=\"font-size:13px\">下，</span>是把</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:7.5pt;font-family:Helvetica,sans-serif;color:rgb(51,51,51);border:1pt none windowtext;padding:0cm\">jiebaR-master</span><span lang=\"ZH-CN\" style=\"font-size:7.5pt;font-family:SimSun;color:rgb(51,51,51);border:1pt none windowtext;padding:0cm\">替换原先的</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:7.5pt;font-family:Helvetica,sans-serif;color:rgb(51,51,51);border:1pt none windowtext;padding:0cm\">jiebaR</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:7pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span lang=\"ZH-CN\" style=\"font-size:7.5pt;font-family:SimSun;color:rgb(51,51,51);border:1pt none windowtext;padding:0cm\">或是把</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:7.5pt;font-family:Helvetica,sans-serif;color:rgb(51,51,51);border:1pt none windowtext;padding:0cm\">jiebaR-master</span><span lang=\"ZH-CN\" style=\"font-size:7.5pt;font-family:SimSun;color:rgb(51,51,51);border:1pt none windowtext;padding:0cm\">加进原来的</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:7.5pt;font-family:Helvetica,sans-serif;color:rgb(51,51,51);border:1pt none windowtext;padding:0cm\">jiebaR</span><span lang=\"ZH-CN\" style=\"font-size:7.5pt;font-family:SimSun;color:rgb(51,51,51);border:1pt none windowtext;padding:0cm\">中</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:7pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"ZH-CN\" style=\"font-size:7pt;font-family:SimSun;background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\">劳烦了</span></p></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,&#39;Segoe UI&#39;,Arial,freesans,sans-serif,&#39;Apple Color Emoji&#39;,&#39;Segoe UI Emoji&#39;,&#39;Segoe UI Symbol&#39;;font-size:14px;line-height:22.4px\"><br></span></div></div>"
