    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">附件是一个编译好了的 Windows 包，这个包是针对 R 3.2.x 用户的。<br><br>也可以使用 devtools 包 从 GitHub 安装最新版的 R 包：<br><br><p>建议使用 gcc &gt;= 4.6 编译，Windows需要安装 <a href=\"http://cran.r-project.org/bin/windows/Rtools/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://cran.r-project.org/bin/windows/Rtools/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793244553301000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1XfV_0uQBqIGAUKLgBVrft\">Rtools</a> ，用于编译 R 包，然后运行以下命令：</p>\r\n\r\n<div><pre><br>library(<span>devtools</span>)\r\ninstall_github(<span><span>&quot;</span>qinwf/jiebaR<span>&quot;</span></span>)\r\nlibrary(<span><span>&quot;</span>jiebaR<span>&quot;</span></span>)</pre></div><br><br>在 2016年4月12日星期二 UTC+8上午12:31:34，Roger Chen写道：</div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:7pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\" lang=\"EN-US\">Issue #29\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size:7pt;font-family:SimSun\" lang=\"ZH-CN\">中提到</span><span style=\"font-size:7pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\" lang=\"EN-US\">\r\nuser_weight</span><span style=\"font-size:7pt;font-family:SimSun\" lang=\"ZH-CN\">的处理</span><span style=\"font-size:7pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:7pt;font-family:SimSun\" lang=\"ZH-CN\">很抱歉，基础不足，想请问您所谓从</span><span style=\"font-size:7.5pt;font-family:Helvetica,sans-serif;color:rgb(51,51,51);border:1pt none windowtext;padding:0cm\" lang=\"EN-US\"> GitHub </span><span style=\"font-size:7.5pt;font-family:SimSun;color:rgb(51,51,51);border:1pt none windowtext;padding:0cm\" lang=\"ZH-CN\">安装就行，该如何做呢？</span><span style=\"font-size:7pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:7pt;font-family:SimSun\" lang=\"ZH-CN\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\" lang=\"ZH-CN\">在</span><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px\" lang=\"EN-US\">window</span><span style=\"font-size:13px\" lang=\"ZH-CN\">下，</span>是把</span><span style=\"font-size:7.5pt;font-family:Helvetica,sans-serif;color:rgb(51,51,51);border:1pt none windowtext;padding:0cm\" lang=\"EN-US\">jiebaR-master</span><span style=\"font-size:7.5pt;font-family:SimSun;color:rgb(51,51,51);border:1pt none windowtext;padding:0cm\" lang=\"ZH-CN\">替换原先的</span><span style=\"font-size:7.5pt;font-family:Helvetica,sans-serif;color:rgb(51,51,51);border:1pt none windowtext;padding:0cm\" lang=\"EN-US\">jiebaR</span><span style=\"font-size:7pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:7.5pt;font-family:SimSun;color:rgb(51,51,51);border:1pt none windowtext;padding:0cm\" lang=\"ZH-CN\">或是把</span><span style=\"font-size:7.5pt;font-family:Helvetica,sans-serif;color:rgb(51,51,51);border:1pt none windowtext;padding:0cm\" lang=\"EN-US\">jiebaR-master</span><span style=\"font-size:7.5pt;font-family:SimSun;color:rgb(51,51,51);border:1pt none windowtext;padding:0cm\" lang=\"ZH-CN\">加进原来的</span><span style=\"font-size:7.5pt;font-family:Helvetica,sans-serif;color:rgb(51,51,51);border:1pt none windowtext;padding:0cm\" lang=\"EN-US\">jiebaR</span><span style=\"font-size:7.5pt;font-family:SimSun;color:rgb(51,51,51);border:1pt none windowtext;padding:0cm\" lang=\"ZH-CN\">中</span><span style=\"font-size:7pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:7pt;font-family:SimSun;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\" lang=\"ZH-CN\">劳烦了</span></p></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,&#39;Segoe UI&#39;,Arial,freesans,sans-serif,&#39;Apple Color Emoji&#39;,&#39;Segoe UI Emoji&#39;,&#39;Segoe UI Symbol&#39;;font-size:14px;line-height:22.4px\"><br></span></div></div></blockquote></div>"
